{"lesson":{"id":"tangente_x3","title":"Pente et équation de la tangente à x = 3 pour f(x) = x² − 4x + 1","language":"fr","learning_goal":"Comprendre que la dérivée en un point est la pente de la tangente, limite des pentes des sécantes, puis la calculer et écrire l'équation de la tangente en x = 3."},"math_context":{"symbols":{"q":{"kind":"parameter","initial":5,"min":3,"max":5}},"expressions":{"pente_sec":"(q^2 - 4*q + 1 - (-2))/(q - 3)"}}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_point","introduces":[{"id":"rep","type":"axes","params":{"x":[-1,6],"y":[-6,10]}},{"id":"courbe","type":"function_graph","params":{"expression":"x^2 - 4*x + 1","domain":[-1,6]},"style":{"role":"accent"}},{"id":"A","type":"point","params":{"at":[3,-2]},"style":{"role":"given"}},{"id":"labA","type":"label","content":"A(3 ; −2)","attachment":{"parent":"A","anchor":"bottom"}},{"id":"regle","type":"math","content":"f(x) = x^2 - 4x + 1","parts":[{"id":"f","text":"f(x) ="},{"id":"expr","text":"x^2 - 4x + 1"}]}],"beats":[{"id":"pose","say":"On cherche la pente de la tangente à la courbe f de x égale x au carré moins quatre x plus un, au point où x vaut trois.","cues":[{"id":"c_fx","text":"f de x égale"},{"id":"c_expr","text":"x au carré moins quatre x plus un"},{"id":"c_trois","text":"x vaut trois"}],"do":[{"id":"cadre","verb":"camera.focus","targets":["rep"],"bounds":"layout_bounds","save_as":"vue_courbe","at":"beat:start"},{"id":"s_rep","verb":"show","target":"rep","at":"beat:start"},{"id":"d_courbe","verb":"draw","target":"courbe","start":"cue:c_fx","end":"cue_end:c_expr"},{"id":"w_f","verb":"write","target":"regle","part":"f","at":"cue:c_fx"},{"id":"w_expr","verb":"write","target":"regle","part":"expr","at":"cue:c_expr"}]},{"id":"pointA","say":"D'abord, je place le point A : je remplace x par trois, et j'obtiens neuf moins douze plus un, donc moins deux.","cues":[{"id":"c_place","text":"je place le point A"},{"id":"c_moinsdeux","text":"moins deux"}],"do":[{"id":"s_A","verb":"show","target":"A","at":"cue:c_place"},{"id":"s_labA","verb":"show","target":"labA","at":"cue:c_moinsdeux"}],"pause_after":"normal"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_secante","introduces":[{"id":"P","type":"point","params":{"at":[5,6]},"style":{"role":"unknown"}},{"id":"labP","type":"label","content":"P(5 ; 6)","attachment":{"parent":"P","anchor":"top"}},{"id":"secante","type":"function_graph","params":{"expression":"4*(x-3) - 2","domain":[-1,6]},"style":{"role":"secondary"}},{"id":"tri_h","type":"line","params":{"from":[3,-2],"to":[5,-2]},"style":{"role":"given"}},{"id":"tri_v","type":"line","params":{"from":[5,-2],"to":[5,6]},"style":{"role":"given"}},{"id":"lab_h","type":"label","content":"avancée : 2","attachment":{"parent":"tri_h","anchor":"bottom"}},{"id":"lab_v","type":"label","content":"montée : 8","attachment":{"parent":"tri_v","anchor":"right"}},{"id":"pente","type":"math","content":"\\dfrac{8}{2} = 4","parts":[{"id":"frac","text":"\\dfrac{8}{2}"},{"id":"egal","text":"= 4"}]}],"beats":[{"id":"sec","say":"Je prends un deuxième point P sur la courbe, à x égale cinq : il est à la hauteur six. Je trace la droite qui passe par A et P, la sécante.","cues":[{"id":"c_cinq","text":"x égale cinq"},{"id":"c_six","text":"hauteur six"},{"id":"c_secante","text":"la sécante"}],"do":[{"id":"s_P","verb":"show","target":"P","at":"cue:c_cinq"},{"id":"s_labP","verb":"show","target":"labP","at":"cue:c_six"},{"id":"d_sec","verb":"draw","target":"secante","start":"cue:c_secante","end":"cue_end:c_secante"}]},{"id":"pente","say":"La pente, c'est la montée divisée par l'avancée. Pour aller de A à P, j'avance de deux et je monte de huit. Huit divisé par deux donne quatre.","cues":[{"id":"c_montee","text":"la montée divisée par l'avancée"},{"id":"c_deux","text":"j'avance de deux"},{"id":"c_huit","text":"je monte de huit"},{"id":"c_quatre","text":"donne quatre"}],"do":[{"id":"s_h","verb":"show","target":"tri_h","at":"cue:c_deux"},{"id":"s_labh","verb":"show","target":"lab_h","at":"cue:c_deux"},{"id":"s_v","verb":"show","target":"tri_v","at":"cue:c_huit"},{"id":"s_labv","verb":"show","target":"lab_v","at":"cue:c_huit"},{"id"