{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_limite","introduces":[{"id":"secante2","type":"function_graph","params":{"expression":"(q^2 - 4*q + 1 + 2)/(q - 3)*(x-3) - 2","domain":[-1,6]},"style":{"role":"secondary"}},{"id":"pentes","type":"matrix","params":{"rows":[[5,4,3.5,3.1],[4,3,2.5,2.1]],"row_labels":["x de P","pente de AP"]}}],"beats":[{"id":"rapproche","say":"Maintenant, je fais glisser P vers A. À x égale quatre, la pente tombe à trois. À trois et demi, deux et cinq. À trois et un, deux et un.","cues":[{"id":"c_glisse","text":"glisser P vers A"},{"id":"c_trois","text":"la pente tombe à trois"},{"id":"c_deuxcinq","text":"deux et cinq"},{"id":"c_deuxun","text":"deux et un"}],"do":[{"id":"f_sec","verb":"fade_out","target":"secante","at":"cue:c_glisse"},{"id":"a_q","verb":"animate_parameter","parameter":"q","from":5,"to":3.1,"start":"cue:c_glisse","end":"cue_end:c_deuxun"},{"id":"d_sec2","verb":"draw","target":"secante2","start":"cue:c_glisse","end":"cue_end:c_deuxun"},{"id":"s_pentes","verb":"show","target":"pentes","at":"cue:c_trois"}]},{"id":"limite","say":"Plus P s'approche de A, plus la sécante ressemble à la tangente. Les pentes s'approchent de deux : la pente de la tangente en A est deux.","cues":[{"id":"c_approche","text":"s'approche de A"},{"id":"c_tangente","text":"ressemble à la tangente"},{"id":"c_deux","text":"la pente de la tangente en A est deux"}],"do":[{"id":"h_pentes","verb":"highlight","target":"pentes","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_approche","end":"cue_end:c_tangente"},{"id":"h_pente","verb":"highlight","target":"pente","part":"egal","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_deux","end":"cue_end:c_deux"}],"pause_after":"normal"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_derivee","introduces":[{"id":"derivee","type":"math","content":"f'(x) = 2x - 4","parts":[{"id":"fprime","text":"f'(x) ="},{"id":"formule","text":"2x - 4"}]},{"id":"calcul","type":"math","content":"f'(3) = 2 \\times 3 - 4 = 2","parts":[{"id":"trois","text":"2 \\times 3 - 4"},{"id":"res","text":"= 2"}]},{"id":"tangente","type":"function_graph","params":{"expression":"2*(x-3) - 2","domain":[-1,6]},"style":{"role":"result"}},{"id":"eqtang","type":"math","content":"y = 2x - 8","parts":[{"id":"y","text":"y ="},{"id":"mx","text":"2x - 8"}]}],"beats":[{"id":"formule","say":"Cette limite, c'est la dérivée. Pour un polynôme, on abaisse l'exposant : x au carré donne deux x, et moins quatre x donne moins quatre. Donc f prime de x égale deux x moins quatre.","cues":[{"id":"c_derivee","text":"la dérivée"},{"id":"c_abaisse","text":"on abaisse l'exposant"},{"id":"c_formule","text":"deux x moins quatre"}],"do":[{"id":"f_pentes","verb":"fade_out","target":"pentes","at":"cue:c_derivee"},{"id":"f_h","verb":"fade_out","target":"tri_h","at":"cue:c_derivee"},{"id":"f_v","verb":"fade_out","target":"tri_v","at":"cue:c_derivee"},{"id":"f_labh","verb":"fade_out","target":"lab_h","at":"cue:c_derivee"},{"id":"f_labv","verb":"fade_out","target":"lab_v","at":"cue:c_derivee"},{"id":"f_P","verb":"fade_out","target":"P","at":"cue:c_derivee"},{"id":"f_labP","verb":"fade_out","target":"labP","at":"cue:c_derivee"},{"id":"w_fprime","verb":"write","target":"derivee","part":"fprime","at":"cue:c_derivee"},{"id":"w_formule","verb":"write","target":"derivee","part":"formule","at":"cue:c_formule"}]},{"id":"eval","say":"Je remplace x par trois : deux fois trois moins quatre, ça donne deux. C'est bien la pente qu'on avait trouvée.","cues":[{"id":"c_remplace","text":"Je remplace x par trois"},{"id":"c_donne","text":"ça donne deux"}],"do":[{"id":"w_trois","verb":"write","target":"calcul","part":"trois","at":"cue:c_remplace"},{"id":"w_res","verb":"write","target":"calcul","part":"res","at":